%% APX AutoMai — Level 1 Data Flow Diagram
flowchart TB
    GUEST[Guest]
    CUST[Customer]
    ADMIN[Administrator]
    CRON[Scheduler / Cron]
    MAIL[Email Service]
    SMSG[SMS Gateway]

    P1["1.0<br/>Authentication and<br/>Role-Based Access"]
    P2["2.0<br/>Vehicle<br/>Management"]
    P3["3.0<br/>Booking and<br/>Scheduling"]
    P4["4.0<br/>Booking<br/>Management"]
    P5["5.0<br/>Notification and<br/>Reminders"]
    P6["6.0<br/>Loyalty<br/>Points"]
    P7["7.0<br/>Reporting and<br/>Dashboard"]

    D1[(D1 users / customers)]
    D2[(D2 vehicles)]
    D3[(D3 services / bundles)]
    D4[(D4 bookings + booking_service)]
    D5[(D5 loyalty_ledger)]
    D6[(D6 audit_logs)]
    D7[(D7 sms_logs)]
    D8[(D8 settings)]

    CUST -->|credentials| P1
    ADMIN -->|credentials| P1
    P1 <-->|account record, role| D1
    P1 -->|session for role| CUST
    P1 -->|session for role| ADMIN

    CUST -->|vehicle details| P2
    P2 <-->|vehicle record| D2

    GUEST -->|guest booking| P3
    CUST -->|service or bundle, date, time, points to use| P3
    P3 -->|read catalogue and prices| D3
    P3 -->|read capacity and hours| D8
    P3 -->|check existing slots| D4
    P3 -->|save booking and price snapshots| D4
    P3 -->|read owned vehicle| D2
    P3 -->|deduct points| P6
    P3 -->|reference number| CUST
    P3 -->|reference number| GUEST
    P3 -->|booking received email| MAIL

    ADMIN -->|confirm, complete, cancel, assign mechanic| P4
    P4 <-->|booking record| D4
    P4 -->|who, what, why| D6
    P4 -->|award or reverse points| P6
    P4 -->|status change notice| MAIL

    CRON -->|scheduled run| P5
    P5 -->|find due bookings| D4
    P5 -->|read template and triggers| D8
    P5 -->|read contact details| D1
    P5 -->|send email| MAIL
    P5 -->|send SMS| SMSG
    P5 -->|record every attempt| D7

    P6 <-->|earn, redeem, expire, adjust| D5
    P6 -->|balance and history| CUST
    ADMIN -->|manual adjustment with reason| P6
    P6 -->|adjustment record| D6

    ADMIN -->|date range filter| P7
    P7 -->|completed work and snapshots| D4
    P7 -->|outstanding points liability| D5
    P7 -->|figures and charts| ADMIN
